                    Remove deprecations from TextSelectionHandleControls instances by @justinmc in <a href="https://github.com/flutter/flutter/pull/124611">124611</a>
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    DraggableScrollableSheet &amp; NestedScrollView  should respect NeverScrollableScrollPhysics by @xu-baolin in 
